  <item>
    <title>vol.3 心灵澡堂实验室-打工人的中午可以做什么</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/662f5c15485813145040e3ad</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">662f5c15485813145040e3ad</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 29 Apr 2024 08:36:36 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>hello，</span></p><span></span><p><span>朋友们，很高兴如期和大家见面，这一期的话题适合打工人解乏。虽然我们是天选打工人，但是我们也要可以享受自己的时光。欢迎和我们一起探索打工人的中午，我们可以做些什么呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="25">00:25</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;为什么要做这一期实验呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;我们做了哪些实验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1415">23:35</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;其他的中午活动推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1818">30:18</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;中午不午睡，会更累吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2013">33:33</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;有什么潜在的风险吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2270">37:50</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;推荐给哪些朋友尝试一下</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2501">41:41</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;总结收获</span></p><span></span><p><span>【ED曲】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Cross My Mind》 Twin Forks</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期出镜：</span></p><span></span><p><span>远远，大北</span></p><span></span><p><span>以下来自实验员的记录拍照：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/luPrehRDRG3CBROE-sqZuVa1WgWD.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/likFe4sbH99tmqjMP0MuzcV9TYPs.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrKefKMjsp3CcepQYBEUcZ5kmKbs.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjWK1SK7YrB-osAStxfB4WmNcoZ_.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
