    <pubDate>Sat, 10 Feb 2024 07:53:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hello 朋友们~很高兴和大家见面！我们是北北和远远~</span></p><span></span><p><span>播客的第一期节目我们准备聊一聊MBTI中的F人的财务观~哈哈虽然非常想做T和F的对比讨论，但是不幸我们俩都是F人哈哈~于是本期就只能讲讲F人~</span></p><span></span><p><span>那24年伊始，各位有没有做新年计划？又有没有在做财务规划呢？在本期节目里我们总结了一下F人容易掉入的消费陷阱，以及我们在23年努力做的一些消费降级和养成一些好的消费习惯小妙招❤️</span></p><span></span><p><span>在本期节目你将听到：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538048364&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=999293240#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538048364&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=999293240#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="239">00:03:59</a></span></a><span> F人是什么❓</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538048364&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=999293240#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538048364&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=999293240#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="351">00:05:51</a></span></a><span> 你作为F人的消费习惯是什么❓快把我的消费习惯拿出来鞭尸❗️</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538048364&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=999293240#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538048364&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=999293240#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1015">00:16:55</a></span></a><span> 消费降级你是怎么做的❓</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538048364&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=999293240#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538048364&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=999293240#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1786">00:29:46</a></span></a><span> 如何养成一个好的消费习惯</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538048364&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=999293240#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538048364&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=999293240#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2643">00:44:03</a></span></a><span> 2023年我买过那些离谱又没用的东西</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538048364&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=999293240#" data-url="https://music.163.com/st/ncreator/manage/voice/edit?voiceId=2538048364&amp;from=1&amp;voicelistId=999293240#"><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3501">00:58:21</a></span></a><span> 2023年买过的幸福感爆棚好物❤️</span></p><span></span><p><span>荣获本次2023年度幸福感排行榜冠军获得者-咔咔隆重出镜！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FknuT0sVh4lYKJrlslnRxtiKj07i.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【ED曲】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Cross My Mind》 Twin Forks</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期出镜：</span></p><span></span><p><span>远远，大北</span></p>]]></description>
